If a patient has a severe-acute-pain and the severe-acute-pain continues after an expected-pain-duration then every clinician should maintain a prolonged-severe-acute-pain-care-mechanism for the patient.
If a patient has a severe-acute-pain and the severe-acute-pain continues after an expected-pain-duration then every clinical-practice-organization should maintain a prolonged-severe-acute-pain-care-mechanism for the patient.
If a patient has a severe-acute-pain and the severe-acute-pain continues after an expected-pain-duration then every health-system should maintain a prolonged-severe-acute-pain-care-mechanism for the patient.
